cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "igvf-scalable-vus-resolution: a scalable approach to resolving variants of uncertain significance"
abstract: >-
  Data-processing pipeline and figure-generation code for harmonizing variant
  effect measurements from published MAVE datasets, annotating them with
  ClinVar/gnomAD/predictor scores, and running the OddsPath/ACMG-AMP
  classification analysis described in the accompanying paper.
authors:
